-      summary: List the YouTube private/unlisted videos in a group.
-      description: |
-        Aggregates YouTube's per-channel `videos.list` (filtered to
-        private/unlisted/processed uploads) for every account that
-        belongs to the requested group. When `include_subgroups=true`
